<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 130-5 V AUSTRALIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 130-5 V AUSTRALIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, set 469 for</p>
<p>victory, were 130 for five at close of play on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the third cricket test against Australia at Old Trafford on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235 and 395-8 declared, England 162 and</p>
<p>130-5.</p>
